A||||3||LAMBO||I can't believe it - exhaust leak||||14||
Z||000000||LAMBO||09-19-2000||10:16 PM||||In the midst of my current engine swap, I knew there was going to be the messy task of removing a broken off manifold bolt out of the rear (trunk side head)because I could feel one missing. This is also where the exhaust leak was coming from. Tonight was the night to tackle it. All I had left to do was remove the ac compressor and drop the donor motor out of the car and I was ready to tear into it. Got out the WD40 and squirted all the bolts down real good. Got out the long handled ratchet and started on the first bolt. I barely put pressure on it and it broke right loose. I thought to myself, dumb luck. Decided to go for the next one, same thing. I couldn't believe it. They all were loose. When I was able to pull the manifold away to see where the "broken" off one had broken, low and behold, clean threads all the way in. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Man, this was my night. The person who worked on this before must have decided that the one behind the alternator was just too tuff to get at with the motor in the car.<P>Sorry for the long post. I just had to tell someone. The wife just doesn't get to thrilled about these things.<BR>Lambo<BR>||||reg||14
Z||000001||2xsess||09-19-2000||11:14 PM||||Lambo, I feel your pain about the wife thing.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>85GT||||reg||1
Z||000002||StuGood||09-20-2000||01:04 AM||||Nice going  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.  By the way, when you get done, if you have any of that kind of luck left over, please send me some  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   I could use it.<P>Incidentally, if you need anything dropped, broken, or damaged, send it to me -  I'm your man.  Hasn't been a good week for me, so far  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> .  Oh, well, at least now I can better appreciate those days when things go right.<P>Come to think of it, that's <B>most</B> days!  Glad you got your exhaust bolts out with ease - and WD-40!  Maybe I'll try it!  <P>   ||||reg||6
